@startuml Kafka Architecture Overview
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Apache Kafka 架构概览图

package "Kafka Ecosystem" {
    
    package "Client Applications" {
        [Producer App] as PROD_APP
        [Consumer App] as CONS_APP  
        [Streams App] as STREAM_APP
        [Connect App] as CONNECT_APP
    }
    
    package "Kafka Clients Library" {
        package "Producer API" {
            [KafkaProducer] as PRODUCER
            [RecordAccumulator] as ACCUMULATOR
            [Partitioner] as PARTITIONER
        }
        
        package "Consumer API" {
            [KafkaConsumer] as CONSUMER
            [ConsumerCoordinator] as COORDINATOR
            [Fetcher] as FETCHER
        }
        
        package "Admin API" {
            [AdminClient] as ADMIN
        }
        
        package "Streams API" {
            [KafkaStreams] as STREAMS
            [StreamsBuilder] as BUILDER
            [StateStore] as STORE
        }
    }
    
    package "Kafka Cluster" {
        package "Broker 1" {
            [SocketServer] as SS1
            [KafkaApis] as API1
            [ReplicaManager] as RM1
            [LogManager] as LM1
            [GroupCoordinator] as GC1
            database "Partitions" as P1
        }
        
        package "Broker 2" {
            [SocketServer] as SS2
            [KafkaApis] as API2
            [ReplicaManager] as RM2
            [LogManager] as LM2
            [GroupCoordinator] as GC2
            database "Partitions" as P2
        }
        
        package "Broker 3" {
            [SocketServer] as SS3
            [KafkaApis] as API3
            [ReplicaManager] as RM3
            [LogManager] as LM3
            [GroupCoordinator] as GC3
            database "Partitions" as P3
        }
        
        [Controller] as CONTROLLER
        [MetadataCache] as METADATA
    }
    
    package "External Systems" {
        database "Source DB" as SRC_DB
        database "Target DB" as TGT_DB
        [Monitoring] as MONITOR
        [Schema Registry] as SCHEMA
    }
}

' Application connections
PROD_APP --> PRODUCER : 发送消息
CONS_APP --> CONSUMER : 消费消息
STREAM_APP --> STREAMS : 流处理
CONNECT_APP --> PRODUCER : 数据集成
CONNECT_APP --> CONSUMER : 数据集成

' Producer flow
PRODUCER --> ACCUMULATOR : 批量累积
ACCUMULATOR --> PARTITIONER : 分区选择
PRODUCER --> SS1 : 网络请求
PRODUCER --> SS2 : 网络请求
PRODUCER --> SS3 : 网络请求

' Consumer flow
CONSUMER --> COORDINATOR : 组协调
CONSUMER --> FETCHER : 数据拉取
FETCHER --> SS1 : 拉取请求
FETCHER --> SS2 : 拉取请求
FETCHER --> SS3 : 拉取请求

' Streams flow
STREAMS --> BUILDER : 拓扑构建
STREAMS --> STORE : 状态存储
STREAMS --> PRODUCER : 内部生产者
STREAMS --> CONSUMER : 内部消费者

' Broker internal flow
SS1 --> API1 : 请求处理
API1 --> RM1 : 副本管理
RM1 --> LM1 : 日志管理
LM1 --> P1 : 存储访问
API1 --> GC1 : 组协调

SS2 --> API2 : 请求处理
API2 --> RM2 : 副本管理
RM2 --> LM2 : 日志管理
LM2 --> P2 : 存储访问
API2 --> GC2 : 组协调

SS3 --> API3 : 请求处理
API3 --> RM3 : 副本管理
RM3 --> LM3 : 日志管理
LM3 --> P3 : 存储访问
API3 --> GC3 : 组协调

' Cluster coordination
CONTROLLER <--> SS1 : 元数据同步
CONTROLLER <--> SS2 : 元数据同步
CONTROLLER <--> SS3 : 元数据同步
CONTROLLER --> METADATA : 元数据更新

' Replication
RM1 <--> RM2 : 副本同步
RM2 <--> RM3 : 副本同步
RM1 <--> RM3 : 副本同步

' External integrations
CONNECT_APP <--> SRC_DB : 数据源
CONNECT_APP <--> TGT_DB : 数据目标
ADMIN --> MONITOR : 监控指标
PRODUCER --> SCHEMA : 模式验证
CONSUMER --> SCHEMA : 模式验证

note top of PRODUCER
  **Producer 特性**:
  - 异步批量发送
  - 分区负载均衡
  - 幂等性保证
  - 事务支持
  
  **核心类**:
  - KafkaProducer.java
  - RecordAccumulator.java
  - Sender.java
end note

note top of CONSUMER
  **Consumer 特性**:
  - 消费者组协调
  - 自动重平衡
  - 偏移量管理
  - 容错恢复
  
  **核心类**:
  - KafkaConsumer.java
  - ConsumerCoordinator.java
  - Fetcher.java
end note

note top of STREAMS
  **Streams 特性**:
  - 高级DSL API
  - 状态管理
  - 时间窗口
  - 容错处理
  
  **核心类**:
  - KafkaStreams.java
  - StreamsBuilder.java
  - StateStore接口
end note

note bottom of SS1
  **Broker 特性**:
  - 高吞吐量存储
  - 副本机制
  - 分区管理
  - 网络优化
  
  **核心类**:
  - SocketServer.scala
  - KafkaApis.scala
  - ReplicaManager.scala
  - LogManager.scala
end note

note bottom of CONTROLLER
  **Controller 职责**:
  - 分区Leader选举
  - 副本分配管理
  - 主题创建删除
  - 集群元数据管理
  
  **实现**:
  - KRaft模式: QuorumController
  - 传统模式: KafkaController
end note

note right of P1
  **存储结构**:
  
  **Topic**: 逻辑概念
  ├── Partition 0 (Leader: Broker1, ISR: [1,2])
  ├── Partition 1 (Leader: Broker2, ISR: [2,3])  
  └── Partition 2 (Leader: Broker3, ISR: [3,1])
  
  **Partition**: 物理存储
  ├── 00000000000000000000.log
  ├── 00000000000000000000.index
  ├── 00000000000000000000.timeindex
  └── leader-epoch-checkpoint
end note

@enduml
